{"municipality_code":"12220","pref":"千葉県","city":"流山市","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"流山市には、流山村、加村、木村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚にまつわる場所が点在し、「深井城跡」、「名都借城跡」、「三輪野山遺跡群」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、流山村や加村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 ゆかりの人物では板沢峰生に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「流山本町江戸回廊」や「近藤勇陣屋跡」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":313,"rank":307,"percentile":83.9,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":231,"rank":34,"percentile":98.3,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":38,"rank":655,"percentile":64.2,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":10,"rank":822,"percentile":51.8,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":5,"rank":776,"percentile":53.6,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":6,"rank":699,"percentile":57.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":1,"rank":574,"percentile":56.3,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":32,"rank":584,"percentile":68.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":1,"rank":102,"percentile":78.1,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["板沢峰生"],"touri